{%- assign s = section.settings -%}
<section class="section faq">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px">
    <div class="eyebrow center">{{ s.eyebrow | default: 'Questions' }}</div>
    <h2 class="center">{{ s.heading | default: 'Before You Order' }}</h2>
    <div style="margin-top:30px">
      {%- if section.blocks.size > 0 -%}
        {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
          <details {% if forloop.first %}open{% endif %} {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <summary>{{ block.settings.question }}</summary>
            <p>{{ block.settings.answer }}</p>
          </details>
        {%- endfor -%}
      {%- else -%}
        <details open><summary>Does it actually plump, or is this just gloss?</summary><p>It's the warmth, not the shine, doing the work: capsicum, ginger root and wintergreen boost circulation right at the surface, which is what creates real (if temporary) volume — 92% of buyers report a visible difference on first use. It's not filler-level change, but it's a real, visible plump, not a marketing photo trick.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Will it burn?</summary><p>It shouldn't. It's dosed for a warm tingle, not a sting — most people feel it as a "buzz" for 30–60 seconds. If it feels like burning rather than warmth, you likely applied too much: one thin layer is all it takes, and more product does not mean more plump.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Will it dry out my lips like other tingle plumpers?</summary><p>No — this is the complaint we built around. Most tingle formulas plump by irritating and drying the lip. Ours pairs the tingle with hyaluronic acid and vitamin E in the same swipe, so moisture goes back in as fast as the warmth draws it out. Lips end up softer after use, not chapped.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How long does the plumping effect last?</summary><p>The visible plump typically lasts 2–4 hours per application and can be topped up any time. With daily use, most people notice smoother, fuller-looking lips even between applications after a few weeks.</p></details>
        <details><summary>Can I wear it under or over lipstick?</summary><p>Both. Wear it alone as a glossy tint, as a base before lip liner and lipstick, or dab it over the top for extra shine and volume.</p></details>
        <details><summary>What if it doesn't work for me?</summary><p>You're covered by our 30-Day Money-Back Guarantee. If you're not happy with your results, contact us for a full refund — no need to send the tube back.</p></details>
        <details><summary>How fast is shipping?</summary><p>Orders are processed within 24–48 hours. Delivery is typically 5–9 business days, with tracking emailed to you once your order ships. Bundles ship free over $35.</p></details>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Questions" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Before You Order" }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "qa",
      "name": "Question",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "question", "label": "Question", "default": "Question?" },
        { "type": "textarea", "id": "answer", "label": "Answer", "default": "Answer." }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "FAQ" }]
}
{% endschema %}
